/	P?S/8 PDP-12 NON-SYSTEM HANDLER

/	P?S/8 LINCTAPE NON-SYSTEM HANDLER FOR THE PDP-12.

/	LAST EDIT:	17-APR-1986	10:00:00	CJL

/	MAY BE ASSEMBLED WITH '/J' SWITCH SET.

/	FEATURES:

/		1)	SUPPORT OF EIGHT UNITS (0-7).

