/	RESTRICTIONS:

/		1)	NO RETRIES ON ERROR.

/		2)	LATEST BLOCK SEARCHED IS IGNORANT OF CHANGE OF LOGICAL UNIT.
	PAGE			/START ON A GOOD BOUNDARY

	HERE=	.		/WHERE WE ARE

